[{"client_msg_id":"94251722-0876-443b-a55f-e0af70a50386","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"尤度主義ってなんだろう。ベイズ主義のうち事前分布に情報を持つのを認めない？的な感じなのかな","ts":"1628348005.081400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jyaH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72759d5d-fdb3-45c6-b213-fdc5b7960945","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"『科学と証拠―統計の哲学 入門―』 エリオット・ソーバー #ブクログ\n\u003chttp://booklog.jp/item/1/4815807124|http://booklog.jp/item/1/4815807124\u003e\n\n読んたけど理解できてない。ベイズ主義、頻度主義、尤度主義の立場があるのは分かった。","ts":"1628347022.080600","attachments":[{"fallback":"『科学と証拠―統計の哲学 入門―』(エリオット・ソーバー)の感想(9レビュー) - ブクログ","id":1,"title":"『科学と証拠―統計の哲学 入門―』(エリオット・ソーバー)の感想(9レビュー) - ブクログ","title_link":"http://booklog.jp/item/1/4815807124","text":"『科学と証拠―統計の哲学 入門―』(エリオット・ソーバー) のみんなのレビュー・感想ページです(9レビュー)。作品紹介・あらすじ：科学的方法の根幹を支える統計的推論の枠組みを丹念に検討し、科学において証拠の果たすべき役割を、哲学者と科学者の双方に向けて明瞭に示した希有な著作。","thumb_url":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Ho9QaLVIL._SL500_.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"booklog.jp","service_icon":"https://booklog.jp/favicon.ico","thumb_width":352,"thumb_height":500,"from_url":"http://booklog.jp/item/1/4815807124","original_url":"http://booklog.jp/item/1/4815807124"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GqF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd2a5c0c-748f-4187-953a-819f94a255aa","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"\u0026gt; ※頻度論：データについての不確実性を確率で表現し、推論する統計学。イェジ・ネイマン（1894～1981）とエゴン・ピアソン（1895～1980）の2人によって確立された統計的仮説検定の枠組みを大きな柱の一つとする。\n\u0026gt; \n\u0026gt; ※ベイズ統計：パラメータや仮説の不確実性を確率で表現し、推論する統計学。トーマス・ベイズ（英、1710〜1761）に端を発し、ラプラス（仏、1749〜1827）が再発見した「ベイズの定理」をその根幹で用いる。","ts":"1628344600.076600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yw7k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b8a0f364-15cc-4742-988c-873fb8b899c0","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"これわかりやすいですね","ts":"1628344500.076400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O2R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5bce000a-82ab-4844-8ab9-365abd4355b4","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"\u003chttps://diamond.jp/articles/-/67725|https://diamond.jp/articles/-/67725\u003e","ts":"1628344481.076000","attachments":[{"fallback":"ダイヤモンド・オンライン: 「頻度論」の学者と「ベイズ論」の学者が対談したら","id":1,"title":"「頻度論」の学者と「ベイズ論」の学者が対談したら","title_link":"https://diamond.jp/articles/-/67725","text":"シリーズ38万部突破の『統計学が最強の学問である』の著者・西内啓氏が、さまざまなゲストと統計学をめぐる対談を繰り広げる連載企画。新たなゲストは、気鋭の統計学者・岡田謙介氏です。統計学を二分する「頻度論」と「ベイズ論」。双方を得意とする学者による希少な対談をお楽しみください。","thumb_url":"https://dol.ismcdn.jp/mwimgs/4/b/-/img_4bb27cc524c54850fecbc6de2a7386b13164.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"ダイヤモンド・オンライン","service_icon":"https://diamond.jp/common/images/apple-touch-icon-iphone.png","thumb_width":72,"thumb_height":72,"from_url":"https://diamond.jp/articles/-/67725","original_url":"https://diamond.jp/articles/-/67725"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Qyj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"821c1df5-5ffe-4f8b-9cd7-23e30d4f2260","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"機械学習だとオンライン学習っでやつになると思います。線型回帰の例もあるので、頻度主義の枠組みとしてもとらえられるかも……？\n\u003chttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Online_machine_learning\u003e","ts":"1628343144.075700","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: Online machine learning","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/","title":"Online machine learning","title_link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Online_machine_learning","text":"In computer science, online machine learning is a method of machine learning in which data becomes available in a sequential order and is used to update the best predictor for future data at each step, as opposed to batch learning techniques which generate the best predictor by learning on the entire training data set at once. Online learning is a common technique used in areas of machine learning where it is computationally infeasible to train over the entire dataset, requiring the need of out-of-core algorithms. It is also used in situations where it is necessary for the algorithm to dynamically adapt to new patterns in the data, or when the data itself is generated as a function of time, e.g., stock price prediction.\nOnline learning algorithms may be prone to catastrophic interference, a problem that can be addressed by incremental learning approaches.","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/Multi-Layer_Neural_Network-Vector-Blank.svg/1200px-Multi-Layer_Neural_Network-Vector-Blank.svg.png","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Online_machine_learning","original_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Online_machine_learning"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pfR4="}]},{"client_msg_id":"76732257-eb7e-4877-b174-36ea4357b9b9","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"そもそも頻度主義の枠組みでこういうリアルタイム推定のアレコレを考えることってできるんだろうか？","ts":"1628337862.074000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/df6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"267c08cd-f09e-4aca-9fce-15d915752edc","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"なのでリアルタイム推定の例を考えるのはベイズ主義の理解に良いと思います","ts":"1628337838.073400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HzU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f787f07d-ebfc-4401-b206-a77c5a9dc245","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"いわゆる統計っぽい問題って、得られた測定値群から推定しましょう！みたいなノリなので、ベイズ主義と頻度主義って結局なんなの？ってなります\nベイズ主義が力を発揮するのは知識の増加が起きる場合（リアルタイム推定みたいに測定結果が増えるとか、コロナ関連のｱﾚｺﾚのように毎日新しい結果が得られるとか）","ts":"1628337809.072900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BHXCI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a7bcf21b-958f-4494-8920-4f22a44215e7","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"カルマンフィルタのようなリアルタイム推定手法だと、\n（いままでの計測結果による）系の知識＋新しい測定結果 →（測定結果が増えることによって更新された）系の知識\nという形で自然とベイズ的な考えが入っているんですよね","ts":"1628337566.070600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bakbr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ada979c-a74d-4dc0-b459-db4bcf4bc5d1","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ところで脱線しますけどこの動画めっちゃ良いのでおすすめしておきます\n\u003chttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zVAq_3HClGs\u0026amp;t=2478s\u003e","ts":"1628337232.067800","attachments":[{"fallback":"YouTube Video: 裏口からのカルマンフィルタ入門","id":1,"author_name":"Ichiro Maruta","author_link":"https://www.youtube.com/user/maru0120","title":"裏口からのカルマンフィルタ入門","title_link":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zVAq_3HClGs\u0026amp;t=2478s","thumb_url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zVAq_3HClGs/hqdefault.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"YouTube","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/youtube.png","thumb_width":480,"thumb_height":360,"video_html":"\u003ciframe width=\"400\" height=\"225\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zVAq_3HClGs?feature=oembed\u0026start=2478\u0026autoplay=1\u0026iv_load_policy=3\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","video_html_width":400,"video_html_height":225,"from_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zVAq_3HClGs\u0026amp;t=2478s","original_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zVAq_3HClGs\u0026amp;t=2478s"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":2,"users":["UL6CFN8NR","U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c=coo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34477b07-37e6-49b3-9e28-7c34eff0d6d9","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"たしかにｗ そういう言い方をすれば同じようなこと言ってるかー","ts":"1628337199.067400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OV6iD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a60f6af4-5961-4fe5-80af-1e7370b0691e","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"よく分かってないのですが、測定された物理量にしろ、「（測定誤差を含めた）観測値」は確定してません？測定誤差はモデルに含めない、みたいな話なのかな。\nまあ直感的な話なのであまり厳密な話をするつもりはないですが","ts":"1628337156.067000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G/k=6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ebb769d8-f7af-494d-957b-13408b08d90a","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"カルマンフィルタによる状態推定とかは良い例だと思います","ts":"1628337092.065800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AEC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46e77fea-cef8-4fb5-8296-606db0790619","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"0/1とか離散値で決まる量（きのこorたけのこ とか）だけじゃなくて、測定された物理量とか（測定値＋測定誤差）","ts":"1628337052.065100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G/L8a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3573a1ad-afad-43ef-8a7d-d2599ee3feac","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"（ぜんぜん分かってないけど厳密な数学の話に主義が現れるのすき　古典論理と直観主義論理とか）","ts":"1628337039.064900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lgOV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f522dcf-2b5a-4d05-866e-5349a340e497","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"うーんそれはどうでしょう\nベイズ主義でも観測値が確定していない場合をとりあつかえますよ","ts":"1628336993.063500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"whDUK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3fabcc67-652b-413d-a07b-f84d2ff2e70d","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"ぼくはこんな感じで理解してます。\n頻度主義的統計学：データの背後にある決まった一つの確率法則があり、そこから得られるデータが揺れているのだという考え方\nベイズ統計学：背後にある法則こそが確率的なのであり、（すでに確定している）観測からそれを推定するのだという考え方","ts":"1628336850.062600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dTf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f51acd33-aaaf-4a78-a115-fc06465354b3","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"僕の理解ですが：\n条件付き確率の条件をひっくり返しても良くね？っていうのがベイズ主義\nいやいやそれは確率的な値じゃないからダメでしょっていうのが頻度主義","ts":"1628336529.060500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sey9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b39b9045-2c33-484e-9a00-3fecc2a92682","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"確率分布に「視点」が含まれることで直感的になりますよね。誰から見るか、どんな知識を持った上でその確率分布になるのか。","ts":"1628336414.058100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P4t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb57d574-d709-4bc1-a7ed-1804aad37e30","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"さっき紹介した『ベイズ統計学概説』ではまさにそんな感じのことが書かれていましたね。ベイズ統計学の枠組みではそのあたりがすっきりする、と。","ts":"1628336364.056700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vSs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef9939a1-4148-4eb1-903a-7c5fa9c4ee8d","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"信頼区間の意味（定義？）としてはmonaqaさんの書いたやつでいいと思うんですけど、頻度主義の枠組みではそれを直感的にわかりやすく言い換えることができないって感じですかね","ts":"1628336285.055800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KaiYM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f333378-96dd-4281-ab6a-ba7580b43fce","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"何が正しいのか完全に混乱しましたが、とりあえず時間が取れるときに大学時代の統計の本を探してきて読み返してみようと思います。ありがとうございますー!","ts":"1628336194.054400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JtEM6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"676b56cc-8b09-434d-9370-4d1435ea04d7","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"（真の値がない場合として物理量の精密計測を挙げようと思ったけど余計にミスリーディングになるかもしれないので黙っておきます。とりあえず真の値の有無を認めるかどうかとベイズかどうかは関係ないかと。ベイズのほうが色々都合いいとは思いますけど）","ts":"1628335798.053300","thread_ts":"1628335798.053300","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kFO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"750ca56e-614d-4a0e-bfed-ce91bb6921c4","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"\u0026gt; 95回では95%信頼区間の範囲内に真の値があります\n後者もここの「真の値」って表現は間違いな気がします。仮定したモデルから得られる点推定が100回中95回入るのはそうですが、真値である必然はないかと。なので、途中で同値に見える赤玉白玉の話は母分布が既知だから同値になってしまうのだと思います。","ts":"1628335789.053100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+/O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"039ac227-adca-4ea8-b248-131b02ba221a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u0026gt; 確率の概念を解釈したもので、ある現象の頻度や傾向の代わりに、確率を知識の状態[1]を表す合理的な期待値[2]、あるいは個人的な信念の定量化と解釈したものである[3]。\nはしっくりきた","ts":"1628335635.049600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q9i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb22733e-7d23-47d6-9348-8b342ac450de","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"真の値があるかどうかは対象に依存します\n例えばきのこたけのこどっち派閥かは全員に聞けば確定しますけど、それは現実的に難しいので100人くらいに聞いて推定するわけです。この例は真の値が存在します","ts":"1628335592.049200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DuG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f30a7b63-c130-4e1b-9556-a64128813f17","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%99%E3%82%A4%E3%82%BA%E7%A2%BA%E7%8E%87\u003e\n\u0026gt; `要するに、ベイズ主義者は、その時点で有する情報をもとに計算された確率を重視する。 （新たな情報が入手されれば確率は改定される。）`","ts":"1628335585.048800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7NrJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d75f28b2-3a44-4cf5-8a71-c932319df620","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"真の値はあると仮定しても、知ることはできないので\n事前分布（対象系の知識）＋なんらかの測定値 → 事後分布 を求めて、それを代わりに使おうぜっていう手法だと理解してます","ts":"1628335469.046700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"njO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08b1d335-c590-46fa-953b-8fbaea9678cf","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"事後分布という形で、対象を確率分布を使って解析しますよね","ts":"1628335235.044700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zfF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a15c3f4-d271-4ad7-bec1-0807e6ae468b","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"あ〜 ごめんなさいちょっとミスリーディングな言葉遣いをした","ts":"1628335205.044100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nAX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b2c112fa-f353-4a41-93bf-facc17c8aa3a","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ん、考えたい対象(真の平均)にも確率分布を許容するのがベイズということですか？","ts":"1628335139.043700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4wD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c831a471-4597-4bf0-96e8-f0b55e70038d","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"対象の確率密度分布をデルタ関数でモデリングするのが非ベイズ、とでも言えるでしょうか。","ts":"1628334930.043500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uVrVg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a26dbb8a-8e5a-47a7-b95f-e7b417f23652","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ベイズと非ベイズの一番の違いは、考えたい対象にも確率分布を許容するかどうかですよね","ts":"1628334842.042600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zflc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83bd6069-912b-47c9-ac97-f8c7f7c988f5","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"monaqaさんのこれが全て説明できていると思いますね","ts":"1628334673.041600","thread_ts":"1628328032.018000","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UM0Ey"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"04e1eb57-0383-4092-bbe0-f7d5111f7612","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"まあとりあえず、\n「母平均という確率的な値があり、それが今推定した信頼区間に入っている確率は95%」という話ではないよ、という点さえ理解できていれば良いのではないかな、と。\n確率的に揺れ動くのは信頼区間の方であって、母平均はあくまで（未知だけど）固定値ですよ、信頼区間を使って推定するようなときはそういう考え方ですよ、という話なんだと思います。","ts":"1628328032.018000","thread_ts":"1628328032.018000","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1628328040.000000"},"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g+8+U"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"d861b2b2-cb32-4dc6-94de-264f5505456f","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"a, b が変数ととらえるか、αが変数ととらえるか、みたいな","ts":"1628334543.041500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ejar2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28b60bb0-a94f-43a8-b392-90832dfdf943","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"何が確率変数なのかが違うのかな","ts":"1628334511.040500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a7IgT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"496cda02-2b96-4c9e-9cfd-7bfcb4fc449f","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"いや、思想的にNG？","ts":"1628334433.039800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NgiX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a3043d8-555e-4fe0-a7d5-61a2ce776db9","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"そっちの量が使われないってことは出すのが難しかったりするのかな","ts":"1628334423.039400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dHUN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ba33c20-e4c2-44ea-b5ed-73c2d86a7147","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"信頼区間が真の平均を含むかどうか、定量できそうだが","ts":"1628334402.038700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y5E3g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e72aa53-8e5a-48e0-90f7-da6274c2c00c","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"古典的統計では後者のように解釈しません、ってだけじゃないかと?","ts":"1628333516.036700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q1hP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e57c6eeb-ef5b-4e97-b088-9119b6ce7271","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"P(a \u0026lt;= α \u0026lt;= b) \u0026gt; 1 - β\nって式をみたときに後者は左辺についての言及で前者は式全体についての言及っぽく聞こえるけど、お気持ちの問題では?","ts":"1628333478.035800","edited":{"user":"UG6DF6W87","ts":"1628334170.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XgQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"63b16e77-ded2-4aaa-9d12-34749d1a9ce9","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u0026gt; 信頼区間として明示されたある区間 A が真の平均値 a を含む確率が 95%\n\u0026gt; 95％の確率で適当な区間 A に真の平均値 a が含まれる\n一緒に思える。。","ts":"1628333283.032700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cRTxW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2dbd3870-8fb7-4881-b357-bf072b73f459","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"このへんむずいですよね","ts":"1628333209.032500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4G3fg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0fca06cc-7a69-4994-a04a-0b5659356134","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"信頼区間として明示されたある区間 A が真の平均値 a を含む確率が 95% \n95％の確率で適当な区間 A に真の平均値 a が含まれる\nは違うって話?","ts":"1628332414.032200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wx9c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06b7221b-baee-4055-ae69-1c0b76d48d32","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"PRML は、というか機械学習の分野ではベイズ的な考え方が強いイメージがあります。これもイメージでしかないですが","ts":"1628330082.028300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iagjQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d68995b-fab2-4a00-b6d9-5ae80ced2c06","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"「パターン認識と機械学習」で機械学習入門したので、私が知ってる統計はベイズ的な統計学だと思いますが、これはベイズでこれはベイズじゃないとか分からないです。俺たちは雰囲気で...","ts":"1628329812.027200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mscVG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27124ade-f8d9-408f-88a8-76532366d8c8","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"実際私も普段ベイズ的な考え方で推定することが多いので「それはあなたの価値観ですよね？」という気持ちになった","ts":"1628329601.027000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7f=SO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1c9b42f-37f3-40c3-bc01-94cc8096ef6a","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"ちなみにこの本には\n\u0026gt; この信頼区間の方法も、細かくいえばネイマン-ピアソン理論が立脚している頻度主義的傾向のゆえに、次項で述べるように論理の飛躍がある。他方、ベイズ統計学の\"ベイズ信頼区間\"の枠組みではこの同じ区間も難点は解消され、まったく問題を残さない。\nとあって、「母平均は固定値」という考え方にはちょっと批判的な立場なのかなと思います。まあベイズ統計学の入門書では自然なのかもしれません。","ts":"1628329516.026000","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1628329547.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o/f/S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c596854-5cde-4b5f-b465-aad03cac083b","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"フィッシャーはこの考え方（=「母平均は固定値だから信頼区間に入っている確率なんてものを考える意味がない」）に異を唱えていたみたいですね。それを「フィデューシャル論」というのだとか。\nつまり、似たような統計学に見えても、考え方、捉え方は一枚岩ではないということのようです。","ts":"1628329032.023800","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1628329109.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sTs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0be23654-b86a-4e7c-be8a-e4961f807fb9","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"\u003chttps://www.amazon.co.jp/%E3%83%99%E3%82%A4%E3%82%BA%E7%B5%B1%E8%A8%88%E5%AD%A6%E6%A6%82%E8%AA%AC%E2%80%95%E3%83%95%E3%82%A3%E3%83%83%E3%82%B7%E3%83%A3%E3%83%BC%E3%81%8B%E3%82%89%E3%83%99%E3%82%A4%E3%82%BA%E3%81%B8-%E6%9D%BE%E5%8E%9F-%E6%9C%9B/dp/4563010065|https://www.amazon.co.jp/%E3%83%99%E3%82%A4%E3%82%BA%E7%B5%B1%E8%A8%88%E5%AD%A6%E6%A6[…]E3%82%BA%E3%81%B8-%E6%9D%BE%E5%8E%9F-%E6%9C%9B/dp/4563010065\u003e\nこの本中古で買ってて、今読みかえしてるんですが、やっぱりそのあたりの話も載ってるんですよね。\nベイズ統計に入る前の、ネイマン-ピアソンの考え方に基づく統計学のところで。","ts":"1628328741.019700","attachments":[{"fallback":"ベイズ統計学概説―フィッシャーからベイズへ","id":1,"title":"ベイズ統計学概説―フィッシャーからベイズへ","title_link":"https://www.amazon.co.jp/%E3%83%99%E3%82%A4%E3%82%BA%E7%B5%B1%E8%A8%88%E5%AD%A6%E6%A6%82%E8%AA%AC%E2%80%95%E3%83%95%E3%82%A3%E3%83%83%E3%82%B7%E3%83%A3%E3%83%BC%E3%81%8B%E3%82%89%E3%83%99%E3%82%A4%E3%82%BA%E3%81%B8-%E6%9D%BE%E5%8E%9F-%E6%9C%9B/dp/4563010065","text":"ベイズ統計学概説―フィッシャーからベイズへ","image_url":"https://images-fe.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/I/41OA3IWSZ%2BL._SR600%2c315_PIWhiteStrip%2cBottomLeft%2c0%2c35_PIStarRatingFOUR%2cBottomLeft%2c360%2c-6_SR600%2c315_SCLZZZZZZZ_FMpng_BG255%2c255%2c255.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"amazon.co.jp","service_icon":"https://www.amazon.co.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.amazon.co.jp/%E3%83%99%E3%82%A4%E3%82%BA%E7%B5%B1%E8%A8%88%E5%AD%A6%E6%A6%82%E8%AA%AC%E2%80%95%E3%83%95%E3%82%A3%E3%83%83%E3%82%B7%E3%83%A3%E3%83%BC%E3%81%8B%E3%82%89%E3%83%99%E3%82%A4%E3%82%BA%E3%81%B8-%E6%9D%BE%E5%8E%9F-%E6%9C%9B/dp/4563010065","original_url":"https://www.amazon.co.jp/%E3%83%99%E3%82%A4%E3%82%BA%E7%B5%B1%E8%A8%88%E5%AD%A6%E6%A6%82%E8%AA%AC%E2%80%95%E3%83%95%E3%82%A3%E3%83%83%E3%82%B7%E3%83%A3%E3%83%BC%E3%81%8B%E3%82%89%E3%83%99%E3%82%A4%E3%82%BA%E3%81%B8-%E6%9D%BE%E5%8E%9F-%E6%9C%9B/dp/4563010065"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0jIk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f2ca11ee-958a-4e95-9228-054ab9471926","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"なるほど。確かにそういう考え方の話なのかも。統計回りの言い回し難しいですね。。","ts":"1628328170.018300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7nLTG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04e1eb57-0383-4092-bbe0-f7d5111f7612","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"まあとりあえず、\n「母平均という確率的な値があり、それが今推定した信頼区間に入っている確率は95%」という話ではないよ、という点さえ理解できていれば良いのではないかな、と。\n確率的に揺れ動くのは信頼区間の方であって、母平均はあくまで（未知だけど）固定値ですよ、信頼区間を使って推定するようなときはそういう考え方ですよ、という話なんだと思います。","ts":"1628328032.018000","thread_ts":"1628328032.018000","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1628328040.000000"},"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g+8+U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9580ac5-051c-47e1-9990-2bb86d46e146","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"うまく説明できそうにないけど、違うのはなんとなくはわかる...","ts":"1628327931.016500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yy6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2b78c6c-0613-4f42-b350-4dcdf913e065","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"同様に確からしくないとかそういう話? うーん。","ts":"1628327735.016100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Tn=N5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"83ba8500-88db-4d7a-9ef6-dda6f84277c4","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"上のリンクには\n\u0026gt; 母平均は決まった値（定数）であり、確率的に変化することはありません。つまり、算出された信頼区間に母平均が「含まれる」か「含まれない」かのどちらかしかありえません。したがって、「母平均が、95％の確率で推定した信頼区間に含まれる」と言うことはできません。\nという説明が書いてありましたが、うーん。","ts":"1628327712.015900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vLV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf079234-b57c-48a6-9a50-a0fd77d3ce45","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"```「母集団から標本を取ってきて、その平均から95%信頼区間を求める、という作業を100回やったときに、95回はその区間の中に母平均が含まれる」\n-\u0026gt; 「母集団から標本を取ってきて、その平均から95%信頼区間を求める、という作業を1回やったときに、95%の確率でその区間の中に母平均が含まれる」```\nはだめなのに (母集団を95個の赤ボールと5個の白ボールとしたときに、)\n```「母集団から標本を取ってきて、その色を確かめる、という作業を100回やったときに、95回は赤である」\n-\u0026gt; 「母集団から標本を取ってきて、その色を確かめる、という作業を1回やったときに、95%の確率で赤である」```\nは良いというのが分からない。","ts":"1628327671.015200","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1628327691.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9/D9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"530d1985-dd49-43ef-bb82-853699404a89","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"うーん。。やっぱり同値に見える。。難しい。。","ts":"1628327434.014800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0a2h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e226aae-ca1b-4308-baf5-f041b0a61bc7","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"しかし、\n「母集団から標本を取ってきて、その平均から95%信頼区間を求める、という作業を100回やったときに、95回はその区間の中に母平均が含まれる」\nという説明も厳密ではないですよね。あくまで直感的な説明にすぎないという感じがします。","ts":"1628327197.014500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yw1zB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c060da66-4410-494a-a996-495ac788c7eb","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"その記事分かりやすいな","ts":"1628326878.011500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dpidh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ee2cc9c-dcb6-4d3d-91e2-58494869b3d1","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"でも正直私も統計学は全然勉強してなくて、通常の信頼区間の算出方法によって求められた信頼区間がなぜこの意味での信頼区間たりうるのか、などはよく理解できてません","ts":"1628326867.011100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bn5Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"14733b72-f03f-48c9-8482-737118e3f789","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"\u003chttps://bellcurve.jp/statistics/course/8891.html\u003e\n適当にググって出てきたこの図がわかりやすそう","ts":"1628326743.009600","attachments":[{"fallback":"統計学の「19-3. 95％信頼区間のもつ意味」についてのページです。統計WEBの「統計学の時間」では、統計学の基礎から応用までを丁寧に解説しています。大学で学ぶ統計学の基礎レベルである統計検定2級の範囲をほぼ全てカバーする内容となっています。","id":1,"text":"統計学の「19-3. 95％信頼区間のもつ意味」についてのページです。統計WEBの「統計学の時間」では、統計学の基礎から応用までを丁寧に解説しています。大学で学ぶ統計学の基礎レベルである統計検定2級の範囲をほぼ全てカバーする内容となっています。","blocks":null,"service_name":"bellcurve.jp","service_icon":"https://bellcurve.jp/img/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://bellcurve.jp/statistics/course/8891.html","original_url":"https://bellcurve.jp/statistics/course/8891.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/j4z4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0470e9d-2eef-4c96-b6d2-efdf4fe900bb","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/conao_3/status/1423928619198418945\u003e\nどなたかフォロー頂けますか？","ts":"1628326109.009200","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/conao_3|@conao_3\u003e: これ良く説明されて後者が合ってるということは知ってるんだけど、じゃあなぜ前者がだめなのかは分かってない。 \u003chttps://twitter.com/TM_Quencher